<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-lauschke-ex-vivo-scaling-mPSM-specimen-match> a pk1:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Lauschke, Tsiairis, François & Aulehla (2013) scale-invariant phase-gradient encoding in ex vivo monolayer presomitic mesoderm (mPSM) — Morphological realism / specimen match: 85/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Panels E-F still segment both bilateral somite rows of the vendored SEM (8 + 8 somites, 47.14 px, CV 0.201) and Panel H now shows the reaggregate disc at cycle 2 (4 foci) and cycle 14 (1 dominant pacemaker at the frequency maximum) with LuVeLu-like cos(theta) colouring, qualitatively matching the multiple-foci to dominant-centre progression of Tsiairis & Aulehla (2016). Deductions: the file is named `mouse_mpsm_somites_specimen.jpg` but the reference table's own `source_url` is a chick embryo SEM, so the only specimen is the wrong species for a Mus musculus slot and was credited as mouse in Pass 2 (-5 relative to Pass 2); no mPSM explant or reaggregate micrograph (Lauschke Fig. 1, Tsiairis Fig. 2) is vendored, so Panels B, G, H are compared with equations, not images (-6); the reaggregate's dominant pacemaker sits on the disc edge because the frequency maximum of the random field is there, whereas the paper's foci are interior (-2); a fully random initial phase field (kappa_init = 0) yields pinned spiral defects and 0 target sources, unlike the re-synchronisation reported in the paper (-2)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-specimen-match> ;
    pk1:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk1:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/specimen-match" ;
    pk1:evidenceAgainst "datasets/ex_vivo_scaling_mPSM/ex_vivo_scaling_mPSM_reference.json L41–L45: specimen source_url is 'Aves_Neural_tube_and_somites_in_chick_embryo.jpg' while the filename and Pass 2 audit call it mouse <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/datasets/ex_vivo_scaling_mPSM/ex_vivo_scaling_mPSM_reference.json#L41-L45>" ;
    pk1:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-lauschke-ex-vivo-scaling-mPSM-specimen-match-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-lauschke-ex-vivo-scaling-mPSM-specimen-match-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-lauschke-ex-vivo-scaling-mPSM-specimen-match-3> ;
    pk1:hasScore 8.5e-01 ;
    pk1:hasVerdict "faithful" .

